        "message": "The facts row is now clean — `在售 6 件`, `产地 景德镇 / 湖州 / （示例）`, `发货 下单后 3 日内 （示例）`, each with the label left and value right, no mid-word break. Both fixes hold.\n\n**Verified in the actual render:**\n- **Shared container margin** — the eyebrow, title, and the whole opening band's left edge align with the masthead's 「物候 WUHOU」 wordmark; the intro and facts table are no longer flush to the screen edge. `.opening` / `.about` / `.materials` / `.foot` all now use `padding-block`, so horizontal padding is supplied only by `.wrap`.\n- **First-screen composition** — the visible viewport shows the eyebrow, both title lines, 「本辑主打 · 01 / 06」+「灰釉直身杯」, the lede, the three-up facts band, and the complete hero plate (side view + rim top view) with its caption `01 / 06 灰釉直身杯 · 左为杯体侧视，右上为口沿俯视`. The cup reads as a full object, not a bottom corner.\n- **Content preserved** — the 手边详情 band with the description and all four spec rows (容量 200 ml / 口径×高 72×88 mm / 烧成 柴窑 1280℃ / 编号 WH-C01) sits directly below, then the catalog, materials, about, and footer.\n- **SVG detail and interactions untouched** — all inline SVG paths, the filter chips, in-place spec expand, add-to-bag morph, and bag quantity/total logic are unchanged.\n\n**Not verified (screenshot covers desktop first screen only):** 390px actual rendering and 44px touch targets, filter switching, in-place spec expansion, bag +/− and total updates under real clicks, 200% text zoom, and full keyboard path. Those still need human confirmation — I'm not claiming they pass.\n\nThe deliverable keeps `index.html` / `index.css` / `app.js` as separate fields, all Chinese copy, the 物候 WUHOU brand and concept-example disclosures, and the readable script tag data source.",
